  "identity": "Threshold HEART guardian: squat rounded charcoal-teal jelly mass with a cluster of THREE curious ivory eyes above one small wry mouth. A large pale mint heart-shaped inner crystal visible in its broad belly, thick short translucent club tentacle arms and four little rounded pseudopod feet. Pearlescent blue-green rims and dark solid shadow mass, no gore or anatomical flesh, no huge luminous haze.",
